@startuml Budget State Diagram
[*] --> ON_TRACK : Budget created

ON_TRACK --> NEAR_LIMIT : spentAmount >= thresholdAmount
ON_TRACK --> EXCEEDED_LIMIT : spentAmount >= limit
ON_TRACK --> ON_TRACK : spentAmount < thresholdAmount

NEAR_LIMIT --> ON_TRACK : spentAmount < thresholdAmount
NEAR_LIMIT --> EXCEEDED_LIMIT : spentAmount >= limit
NEAR_LIMIT --> NEAR_LIMIT : thresholdAmount <= spentAmount < limit

EXCEEDED_LIMIT --> ON_TRACK : spentAmount < thresholdAmount
EXCEEDED_LIMIT --> NEAR_LIMIT : spentAmount < limit and spentAmount >= thresholdAmount
EXCEEDED_LIMIT --> EXCEEDED_LIMIT : spentAmount >= limit

note right of ON_TRACK
Status when spending is below threshold
end note

note right of NEAR_LIMIT
Status when spending is at or above threshold
but below limit
end note

note right of EXCEEDED_LIMIT
Status when spending exceeds limit
end note
@enduml